# Data
# The RAG corpus, its embeddings index and the seeded user profiles ARE
# committed on purpose: they are the knowledge base and the demo fixtures.
# Judges clone this repo and must get a working system, so excluding them
# would ship an empty agent. Only local scratch is ignored.
data/**/.cache/
*.tmp
